\begin_layout Standard
GPG card access is granted via the 
\family typewriter
scdaemon
\family default
 process (part of GnuPG) via the PCSD daemon.
 To allow easy access to YubiKeys and other devices which also offer smartcard features,
 the 
\family typewriter
$HOME/.gnupg/scdaemon.conf
\family default
 file in each zone is initially created with the following contents:
\begin_inset listings
