\begin_layout Itemize
events generated when using the padsi-do tool (refer to section 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "padsi-do-tool"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset

) are in 
\family typewriter
padsi-do.<year>-<month>-<day>.json
\family default
 files.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Note:
