Misc.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Subsubsection
Controlled access to zone's associated files
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The 
\family typewriter
data-access-guard
\family default
 program (an eBPF LSM program type) prevents programs running in the 
\begin_inset Quotes eld
\end_inset

init namespace
\begin_inset Quotes erd
\end_inset

 (and not as root) from:
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
reading or writing any zone's associated files (to avoid zone's policies bypass,
 refer to section 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "Files-isolation"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset

);
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
modifying the log files generated by components in the zones.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
This program is an LSM type program which intercepts files accesses and only allows access for the root user.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
It logs all denied accesses to syslog.
\end_layout

