\begin_layout Section
\start_of_appendix
Windows VM installation
\begin_inset CommandInset label
LatexCommand label
name "Annex:Windows VM"

\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
PADSI uses the 
\begin_inset CommandInset href
LatexCommand href
name "virtIO"
target "https://wiki.osdev.org/Virtio"
literal "false"

\end_inset

 system to para-virtualize hardware seen by guest operating systems in virtual machines.
 Linux natively includes the associated drivers but Windows does not.
 The drivers must thus be loaded before installing Windows in the VM as otherwise the virtual hard disk will not be 
\begin_inset Quotes eld
\end_inset

seen
\begin_inset Quotes erd
\end_inset

 by the Windows installer.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The drivers can be downloaded from:
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\begin_inset CommandInset href
LatexCommand href
target "https://fedorapeople.org/groups/virt/virtio-win/direct-downloads/"
literal "false"

\end_inset

 (multiple formats available);
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\begin_inset CommandInset href
LatexCommand href
target "https://github.com/virtio-win/virtio-win-pkg-scrips/blob/master/README.md"
literal "false"

\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Also,
 access to actual files in the host from the VM is implemented using 
\begin_inset CommandInset href
LatexCommand href
name "Virtiofs"
target "https://virtio-fs.gitlab.io"
literal "false"

\end_inset

.
 Again,
 Windows is not natively aware of this filesystem and specific 
\begin_inset CommandInset href
LatexCommand href
target "https://winfsp.dev"
literal "false"

\end_inset

 drivers must be installed:
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
download from 
\begin_inset CommandInset href
LatexCommand href
target "https://github.com/winfsp/winfsp/releases"

\end_inset

 or 
\begin_inset CommandInset href
LatexCommand href
target "https://winfsp.dev/rel/"

\end_inset

;
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
silent installation can be done () adapt to exact version:
\begin_inset listings
lstparams "basicstyle={\footnotesize\ttfamily}"
inline false
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout

msiexec /i winfsp-2.0.23075.msi /qn INSTALLLEVEL=1000
\end_layout

\end_inset


\end_layout

